meta {
  name: Search By Date (mentions)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  query: {{company_name}}
  tags: story
  numericFilters: created_at_i>1718409600
  hitsPerPage: 15
}

docs {
  hits[] fields we use:
  - title, url, points, num_comments, objectID, created_at, story_id

  Filters in code:
  - mentions: points >= 10 OR num_comments >= 5 → news_mention
  - Show HN + domain match in url host → product_launch

  Update numericFilters timestamp (Unix) for last 7 days.
}
